---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contact" class="bg-coffee-bean border-t border-lavender-blush/10 pt-20" aria-label="Pied de page et contact">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 pb-16">

    <div class="lg:col-span-2">
      <img src="/assets/logo.png" alt="Logo S-MH'air" class="h-16 w-auto mb-6" />
      <p class="text-lavender-blush/60 font-light mb-8 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
        Avec 15 ans d'expérience, je me déplace chez vous autour de Stutzheim et Wasselonne pour un moment de détente personnalisé — dans la simplicité et la bonne humeur.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="p-3 bg-graphite rounded-full text-golden-bronze hover:bg-golden-bronze hover:text-coffee-bean transition-all"
          aria-label="Instagram de S-MH'air"
        >
          <!-- Instagram SVG -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5" />
            <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z" />
            <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/people/S2MHair/61573298836918/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="p-3 bg-graphite rounded-full text-golden-bronze hover:bg-golden-bronze hover:text-coffee-bean transition-all"
          aria-label="Facebook de S-MH'air"
        >
          <!-- Facebook SVG -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <address class="not-italic">
      <h3 class="text-golden-bronze font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-6">Contact</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-lavender-blush/70">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-golden-bronze shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1 1 15 0Z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Coiffeuse à domicile<br />Stutzheim · Wasselonne &amp; alentours<br /><span class="text-golden-bronze/70">Bas-Rhin (67)</span></span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lavender-blush/70">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-golden-bronze shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 0 1-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 0 0-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 4.5v2.25Z" />
          </svg>
          <a href="tel:0637737142" class="hover:text-golden-bronze transition-colors">06 37 73 71 42</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lavender-blush/70">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-golden-bronze shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07-1.916V6.75" />
          </svg>
          <a href="mailto:Meisse.samantha@gmail.com" class="hover:text-golden-bronze transition-colors">Meisse.samantha@gmail.com</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </address>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-golden-bronze font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-6">Horaires</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-lavender-blush/70 font-light">
        <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Lundi – Samedi</span><span>Sur RDV</span></li>
        <li class="mt-4 italic text-golden-bronze/60 text-xs">Uniquement sur réservation téléphonique.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-lavender-blush/5 py-8 text-center text-lavender-blush/40 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase space-y-2">
    <p>TVA non applicable — Article 293B du CGI</p>
    <p>© {year} S-MH'air. Tous droits réservés. <span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">|</span> Design by Samantha Meisse</p>
  </div>
</footer>
